{"bangumi":{"date":"1989-04-15","platform":"剧场版","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/dc/f8/26592_H868J.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/dc/f8/26592_H868J.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/dc/f8/26592_H868J.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/dc/f8/26592_H868J.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/dc/f8/26592_H868J.jpg"},"summary":"　　《迷宫物语》（原题同，外文副标：Manie-Manie）为根据眉村卓短篇小说作品《口袋里的XYZ》（原题：ポケットのXYZ）改编的动画电影。全片包括“迷宫＊迷宫”（ラビリンス＊ラビリントス）、“狂奔者”（走る男）、“工程中止命令”（工事中止命令）三个单元，以短篇形式构成。片长50分。\r\n　　本片原预定于1986年，与角川当年主打的动画长片《时空旅人》（原题：時空の旅人）同时上映，但因制作进度不及而以《火鸟 凤凰篇》取代。完成后先在1987年9月25日于“东京奇幻电影节'87”放映，同年推出影带上市，两年后的1989年4月，以小规模单院上映方式于院线推出。而这段期间一直未能上映的原因，则是因为看过成品之后的当时制片人角川春树，认为风格太过前卫冷僻而束之高阁。","name":"迷宮物語","name_cn":"迷宫物语","tags":[{"name":"大友克洋","count":246,"total_count":6341},{"name":"剧场版","count":223,"total_count":728177},{"name":"MADHouse","count":194,"total_count":111077},{"name":"川尻善昭","count":188,"total_count":2537},{"name":"1989","count":143,"total_count":6121},{"name":"林太郎","count":95,"total_count":341},{"name":"原创","count":83,"total_count":624128},{"name":"OVA","count":82,"total_count":366845},{"name":"科幻","count":66,"total_count":254422},{"name":"短片","count":49,"total_count":102750},{"name":"りんたろう","count":38,"total_count":231},{"name":"短片集","count":21,"total_count":2605},{"name":"80年代","count":17,"total_count":2219},{"name":"小说改","count":14,"total_count":161228},{"name":"映画","count":12,"total_count":6313},{"name":"日本","count":10,"total_count":300902},{"name":"林重行","count":7,"total_count":77},{"name":"1980s","count":6,"total_count":1097},{"name":"补旧番","count":6,"total_count":5343},{"name":"1989年","count":5,"total_count":305},{"name":"动画电影","count":5,"total_count":44097},{"name":"福岛敦子","count":5,"total_count":89},{"name":"迷宮物語","count":5,"total_count":5},{"name":"奇幻","count":4,"total_count":475595},{"name":"大塚伸治","count":4,"total_count":75},{"name":"电影","count":4,"total_count":13643},{"name":"独立剧场版","count